{"seq":3,"slug":"biosignature-detection","title":"生命标志物探测（Biosignature Detection）","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/astronomy-cosmology/astrobiology/biosignature-detection","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"atmospheric-biosignatures","title":"大气生物标志物（Atmospheric Biosignatures）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/astronomy-cosmology/astrobiology/biosignature-detection/atmospheric-biosignatures","wordCount":1999,"readingTime":8},{"seq":2,"slug":"surface-subsurface-signs","title":"地表与地下生命迹象（Surface and Subsurface Signs of Life）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/astronomy-cosmology/astrobiology/biosignature-detection/surface-subsurface-signs","wordCount":2358,"readingTime":10},{"seq":3,"slug":"technosignatures","title":"技术信号（Technosignatures）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/astronomy-cosmology/astrobiology/biosignature-detection/technosignatures","wordCount":2261,"readingTime":10}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"生命标志物探测-biosignature-detection\">生命标志物探测（Biosignature Detection）</h1><h2 id=\"概述\">概述</h2><p>生命标志物（biosignature）是指任何可被观测到的、暗示过去或现在存在生命的物质、结构或现象。本章从大气光谱分析、地表/地下物理化学痕迹到技术文明信号三个层面，系统阐述如何远程或原位探测外星生命。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心议题\">核心议题</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>议题</th>\n<th>探测方式</th>\n<th>目标类型</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>大气生物标志物</td>\n<td>远程光谱观测</td>\n<td>微生物级别生命</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>地表与地下迹象</td>\n<td>原位探测/样品分析</td>\n<td>化石或活体微生物</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>技术信号</td>\n<td>射电/光学/红外搜索</td>\n<td>智慧文明</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"学习路径\">学习路径</h2><p>三篇文档覆盖生命探测的完整光谱：从微生物级的化学信号（大气和地表）到文明级的工程信号（技术信号），展示天体生物学从&quot;寻找简单生命&quot;到&quot;寻找智慧生命&quot;的完整策略。</p>\n"}